<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 60, background: '#FFFFFF', position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei, Arial' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 600 }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 58, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#12324F', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>5000 人扩容提速：三种付费路径</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 1, width: '100%', background: '#12324F' }} />
    <Box style={{ height: 34, marginTop: 12, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>一次决策，把交付周期从 5 天压缩到 1.5–3 小时</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 400, marginTop: 18, gap: 40 }}>

      <Box style={{ width: 480, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>推荐 · 一次性预付</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', marginTop: 14, height: 124 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 84, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E07B39', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>$10</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#64748B', marginBottom: 14, marginLeft: 18, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>约 ¥72</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#12324F', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 12 }}>
          买一次预付，5,000 人<br />从约 5 天缩到 1.5–3 小时
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 18 }}>
          慢的原因不是限速：新账号首 $1 按<br />$0.10/5 分钟释放，约 50 分钟才花完。<br />预付额度不受此节流。
        </Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#12324F', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>三种路径对比</Text>
        <Box style={{ height: 88, marginTop: 12, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', borderBottom: '1px solid #E9F1F8' }}>
          <Text style={{ width: 210, fontSize: 19, color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>不提速</Text>
          <Text style={{ width: 170, fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>约 5 天</Text>
          <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 17, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>$9.8 · 免费额度覆盖</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 88, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', borderBottom: '1px solid #E9F1F8', background: '#F4FAF9' }}>
          <Text style={{ width: 210, fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F766E', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>预付 $10 · 推荐</Text>
          <Text style={{ width: 170, fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E07B39', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>1.5–3 小时</Text>
          <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 17, color: '#0F766E', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>约 ¥72 · 3 个月有效</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 88, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', borderBottom: '1px solid #E9F1F8' }}>
          <Text style={{ width: 210, fontSize: 19, color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>年付 Member</Text>
          <Text style={{ width: 170, fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>约 1 小时</Text>
          <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 17, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>¥36,000/年 · 含每日同步</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 56, marginTop: 16, padding: 14, background: '#E9F1F8', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#12324F', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
        关键提醒：必须用 Settings → API key 里的<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C2410C' }}>账户主 key</span>；AI agent 生成的 key 只花免费额度，无法扣预付余额。
      </Text>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 18, left: 60, right: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>OpenAlex 科研分析平台 · 商务沟通稿</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>来源：help.openalex.org · 规则核实 2026-11-25</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
